E0058 (https://starstream.nightstream.dev/errors/E0058)

  x `let ... else` fallback must diverge
   ,-[test.star:2:41]
 1 | fn invalid(result: Result<i64, i64>) {
 2 |     let Result::Ok(value) = result else { let fallback = 0; };
   :                                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 3 | }
   `----
  help: make the `else` block exit control flow with `return` or `resume`
